          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yese walī ntemi wa Isilaeli ī yose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbatema a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè, myaka mpungatī alī Hebuloni, na myaka makūmi adatū n'īdatū alī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akacha alī namhala wa būlamu wa myaka mingī; namhala nsabi, hangī akūjiwe na banhū; ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Solomoni h'ūyo wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū ī milīmo ya ng'wa Daūdi, kūfuma wandījo wayo kūshisha kū būkalīkījo wayo, yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha moni Sang'weli, na ng'hangi Nasani, na mu shandīkwa sha moni Gadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pyī nī mihayo ya būsugi wakwe, nū būdūla wakwe, nī yīngī īyo yang'wilongela, nī yīyo yabilongela Baisilaeli, nī yīyo yabilongelaga ū mu mabūtemi a gose a ga mu sī ī jingī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
